      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary thrombosis is a perilous disease. Animal experiments may contribute to investigate its pathogenesis and treatment. The development of an experimental model of coronary thrombosis on closed thorax is important. In this report the methodics of such model is entered into, pointing at its dangers and possible complications."},
